# Unearth {8} (CR 702.84a) is an activated ability, not a cast (ruling 2022-10-14), so "when you cast this spell" does not
# trigger: while the unearth ability waits on the stack, nothing is above it. The unearthed Leveler has haste, attacks, and its attack
# trigger destroys Mox Jet (Bot2 creates a tapped Powerstone); it is exiled at the beginning of the next end step.
# Set-up: Faithless Looting discards the Leveler on turn 1; five Moxen and three lands pay {8} on turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
